WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.060
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:17.560
Last time: AI finds patterns, then guesses

3
00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:23.630
Chapter 2 · Smart vs. Simple

4
00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:32.000
Is every gadget with a button AI?

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:43.570
6:30 on a Saturday. Ring, ring!

6
00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:56.030
Mini: "This torch is so smart. It's AI!"

7
00:00:56.030 --> 00:01:03.120
Is a torch AI? What do you think?

8
00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:15.070
Two kinds: simple and smart

9
00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:21.510
Simple programs follow FIXED RULES

10
00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:35.500
If the button is pressed → play a sound

11
00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:48.080
At 6:30 → ring. Every single day!

12
00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:57.890
Torch: switch on → light on

13
00:01:57.890 --> 00:02:08.310
Simple programs never learn anything new

14
00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:20.750
Sunday, 6:30. What will the alarm do?

15
00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:33.200
Ring! The fixed rule never changes.

16
00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:44.180
AI learns from examples, and changes

17
00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:52.940
Learning = getting better from more examples

18
00:02:52.940 --> 00:03:05.470
A voice assistant hears millions of voices

19
00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:12.910
More examples → better at understanding

20
00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:23.640
Oops! You type "becuase"

21
00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:31.760
Spellcheck learned words from lots of writing

22
00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:42.770
Photo search learned from example photos

23
00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:54.620
Video suggestions change as you watch more

24
00:03:54.620 --> 00:04:01.910
Does it change after more examples?

25
00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:10.850
Yes → it may be AI

26
00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:24.970
No → a simple, fixed-rule program

27
00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:30.060
Sort it: fixed rule, or learns?

28
00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:46.750
Which ones learn from examples?

29
00:04:46.750 --> 00:05:03.100
3 follow fixed rules · 3 learn from examples

30
00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:13.530
A DESIGNER writes and plans a program

31
00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:24.630
People design simple programs AND AI

32
00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:33.140
People choose the examples AI learns from

33
00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:41.750
AI doesn't build itself. People are in charge!

34
00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:45.700
Your turn: practice check

35
00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:59.120
Is a torch AI? Why or why not?

36
00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:15.460
No! One fixed rule. It never learns or changes.

37
00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:21.230
Simple programs follow fixed rules

38
00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:25.170
AI changes after seeing more examples

39
00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:29.480
A torch is not AI. It just follows a switch.

40
00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:33.260
People design both

41
00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:38.610
Chapter 2 done!

42
00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:45.410
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
